  "description": "A high-performance, responsive Single-Page Application (SPA) built for students, parents, and teachers. Can be hosted for **free on static hosting** (Cloudflare Pages, Vercel, Netlify) or packaged as an **Android APK / Google Play Store App** using Capacitor or TWA.",
